    <!--
        Icon geometries, all drawn on a 24x24 box and meant to be STROKED, not filled. Render them
        with the IconGlyph control, which fixes the viewbox, stroke thickness and round caps and
        tints the stroke from Foreground, so an icon inside a disabled button dims with it.

        No icon font: a font is one more file a production machine must have installed, and a
        missing one shows up as empty boxes at runtime instead of a build error.

        Names describe the picture, not a page: IconTarget, not IconInspect.
    -->

